--------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DATA REDISTRIBUTED IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. CarbonCast hourly grid carbon intensity and generation-by-fuel data
   Files: data/raw/pjm/PJM_direct_emissions.csv
          data/raw/pjm/PJM_lifecycle_emissions.csv
          data/raw/pjm/PJM_2019_clean.csv
   Source: https://github.com/carbonfirst/CarbonCast
   License: Apache License 2.0
   CarbonCast derives these series from U.S. Energy Information
   Administration hourly electric grid monitor data.

   Used by: carbon-aware-der (all carbon intensity and marginal
   emissions results).

2. Berkeley Lab "Queued Up" interconnection queue dataset (2025 release,
   data through end of 2024)
   File: data/raw/lbnl/LBNL_Ix_Queue_Data_File_thru2024_v2.xlsx
   Source: Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory,
           https://emp.lbl.gov/queues
   Berkeley Lab publishes this dataset publicly for research use. It is
   redistributed here unmodified so the analysis is reproducible from a
   clean clone. Berkeley Lab is the authoritative source; consult
   emp.lbl.gov/queues for the current release and any use conditions.

   emp.lbl.gov was not reachable from the environment this repository was
   built in. The workbook was obtained from a third-party GitHub mirror.
   The file is Berkeley Lab's own published workbook; no code from the
   mirroring repository was used, and all analysis here is written
   independently from the raw workbook. See
   interconnection-analytics/README.md.

   Used by: interconnection-analytics.

3. PJM Interconnection queue snapshot
   File: data/raw/pjm/pjm_queue_snapshot_2026-05-05.parquet
   Source: PJM Interconnection serial service request queue,
           https://www.pjm.com/planning/service-requests/services-request-status
   A point-in-time export of PJM's public queue, obtained from the same
   third-party mirror as item 2.

   Used by: interconnection-analytics.

